[{"answer":"Conference Centre Reservations. Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi. I'm interested in the computing conference next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Future Directions in Computing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I ask you a few questions about it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/6.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I know the conference is for three days","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/8.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually I want to attend on the Friday and Saturday only.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Will that work out to be any cheaper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you could register for the two days separately,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but that wouldn't actually save you very much","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/13.mp3"},{"answer":"as it still costs £35 for each day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/14.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, if you could register for the three days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/15.mp3"},{"answer":"you also get an invitation to a free dinner on the Saturday night,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/16.mp3"},{"answer":"so that's probably the better option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I'll do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/18.mp3"},{"answer":"How much will the fees be in that case?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £75.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/20.mp3"},{"answer":"All right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to register for the full three days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, can I pay that by credit card?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/24.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to send a cheque to us,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/25.mp3"},{"answer":"or you can pay at the conference office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/27.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's probably easiest if I pay by cheque.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Now then, what else do I need to arrange?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. How about accommodation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess that's not included in the price?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/31.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm sorry, it's not,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/32.mp3"},{"answer":"but we do have a few rooms available for delegates at the conference centre if you'd like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Those are very cheap but if you're interested you'll need to book soon,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/34.mp3"},{"answer":"because there's always a heavy demand for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/35.mp3"},{"answer":"They are only £15 per night,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but they are very basic and you'd have to get your own breakfast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/37.mp3"},{"answer":"because they don't provide you with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/38.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's very convenient,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/39.mp3"},{"answer":"because it's in the same building as the conference rooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhuh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Or there's a very reasonable guest house which is £25 per night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And I think that includes your breakfast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it close to the conference centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be about a ten-minute walk away from here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds quite reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The details are all in our conference pack, which I'll send you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/49.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be very useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and can you also send me an application form?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll get that in the post to you straight away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you tell me where exactly the conference centre is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's on South Park Road and it's right at the end of the road next to the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a ten-minute taxi ride from the station","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and will cost you £5.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Otherwise, you can take the bus which runs every half an hour from the station,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/60.mp3"},{"answer":"that's the 21A,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and it brings you straight to the conference centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-1-2023-08-03-14-46-51/63.mp3"}]
